// Title: Suspicious Debugger Registration Cmdline
// Rule ID: ae215552-081e-44c7-805f-be16f975c8a2
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1546.008
// Category: process_creation
